@baseUrl = http://localhost:5238

### ===== IAM =====

### IAM 1. Sign up (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en


{
  "firstName": "Eduardo",
  "lastName": "Salazar",
  "email": "eduardo@petstock.pe",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "+51999888777",
  "role": "Owner"
}


