### ===== Sales =====

### Sales 1. Create a sale with two items (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sales
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "userId": 1,
  "customerId": null,
  "paymentMethod": "cash",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 35.50
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 120.00
    }
  ]
}

